## 4. 锚点配准叠加

- 参考题目: 15 (66f2d22f), 13 (a2fd1cf0), 2 (2204b7a8)
- tags:
  - operation:透明叠加, transparent_overlay
  - operation:平移, translate
  - operation:对齐, align
